/* Gzip container: magic(2) + CM(1) + FLG(1) + MTIME(4) + XFL(1) + OS(1)
 * = 10 byte sabit header, ardindan FLG bitlerine gore degisken alanlar
 * (FEXTRA/FNAME/FCOMMENT/FHCRC), sonra ham deflate akisi, en sonda da
 * 8 byte trailer (CRC32 + ISIZE) - RFC 1952. */
